Minimal Nginx pattern from this skill:
```nginx
server {
    listen 443 ssl;
    http2 on;
    server_name example.com;
    ssl_certificate     /etc/letsencrypt/live/example.com/fullchain.pem;
    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/example.com/privkey.pem;
    ssl_protocols TLSv1.2 TLSv1.3;
}
```
Validate and reload with `nginx -t && systemctl reload nginx`. Let's Encrypt default DV certs last 90 days—renew around day 60. Rehearse with `certbot renew --dry-run` before relying on the timer; use staging while developing ACME clients so production rate limits stay clear.
